{"availability":"available","full":"Novage/p2p-media-loader","name":"p2p-media-loader","description":"An open-source engine for P2P streaming of live and on demand video directly in a web browser HTML page","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1727,"forks":345,"created":"2018-08-07T20:06:34Z","updated":"2026-10-09T19:14:42Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://novage.com.ua/p2p-media-loader/demo.html","topics":["bittorrent","dash","hls","hlsjs","media-playback","mediastream","p2p","p2p-media-loader","p2p-network","peer","player","shaka-player","video","webrtc","webtorrent"],"demo":"http://novage.com.ua/p2p-media-loader/demo.html","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:47.761Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:47.761Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:47.761Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T23:11:47.761Z","stars":1727,"forks":345}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["P2P Media Loader is an open-source JavaScript library that uses modern browser technologies — like HTML5 video and WebRTC — to enable peer-to-peer (P2P) media delivery. It integrates seamlessly with popular HTML5 video players and requires no additional browser plugins or add-ons. Try the demo to see it in action.","This library makes it possible to build large-scale P2P mesh networks — often called peer-to-peer content delivery networks (P2P CDN), Hybrid CDN, Multi CDN, peer-to-peer television (P2PTV), or Enterprise Content Delivery Networks (eCDN) — enabling users who are watching the same live or on-demand (VOD) streams via HLS or MPEG-DASH to share traffic in real time.","For smaller setups (1,000–2,000 simultaneous viewers), public trackers alone can handle peer connections. This means you don’t need to install or maintain any additional server-side components in many cases. Free alternatives are available for larger setups that can handle 100k simultaneous peers and above. Check our article on running dedicated trackers."],"features":["No Setup Cost and No Server Software Needed:","Reduced Load on Origin:","Significant Cost Savings:","Enhanced Total Bandwidth:","Flexible for Live & VOD:"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Novage/p2p-media-loader/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5c08a4c4b62acc3c42bc741e041db4b31352a2290fdad0f1f990517c0e4da3d2","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:47.879Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:47.879Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"P2P Media Loader is an open-source JavaScript library that uses modern browser technologies — like HTML5 video and WebRTC — to enable peer-to-peer (P2P) media delivery. It integrates seamlessly with popular HTML5 video players and requires no additional browser plugins or add-ons. Try the demo to see it in action.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Novage/p2p-media-loader/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"not_required","text":"No Setup Cost and No Server Software Needed:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Novage/p2p-media-loader/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"5c08a4c4b62acc3c42bc741e041db4b31352a2290fdad0f1f990517c0e4da3d2","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Novage/p2p-media-loader/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:47.880Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T19:14:42Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Novage/p2p-media-loader/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:47.881Z","hash":"5c08a4c4b62acc3c42bc741e041db4b31352a2290fdad0f1f990517c0e4da3d2","originalBytes":9791,"storedBytes":9791,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["media","p2p","loader","peers","cdn","video","webtorrent","integration","hls.js","network","player","public","required","server","shaka","tracker","wss","available","delivery","over","players","segments","stun","supports","trackers","android","browser","ios","library","live","servers","software","source","webrtc","additional","apps","bandwidt